cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use the Slop Goblin in a talk, article or paper, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "The Slop Goblin"
abstract: >-
  A browser bookmarklet that walks down a LinkedIn feed eating buzzwords and corporate
  phrases, replaces them with plain English, and prints an itemised receipt of what it ate.
  It runs entirely in the browser, with no network requests.
